Iroha 1 @IROHA_DIST_PLATFORM@ (@IROHA_DIST_VERSION@)
====================================================

bin/
  irohad@IROHA_EXE@            - Iroha node
  iroha-cli@IROHA_EXE@         - command-line client (interactive and JSON modes)
  iroha_migrate@IROHA_EXE@     - WSV migration tool (PostgreSQL <-> RocksDB)
  iroha_wsv_diff@IROHA_EXE@    - WSV comparison tool

example/         - single-node network on RocksDB (no PostgreSQL needed):
                     cd example
                     ../bin/irohad@IROHA_EXE@ --config config.json \
                       --genesis_block genesis.block --keypair_name node0
                   then in another console:
                     ../bin/iroha-cli@IROHA_EXE@ --account_name admin@test

iroha-lib/
  include/       - headers of the C++ client library; add ALL of these
                   include directories, in this order:
                     include/iroha-lib
                     include/shared_model
                     include/libs
                     include/irohad
                     include/gen/schema
  lib/
    @IROHA_ALL_LIB@ - ALL Iroha static libraries merged into one archive;
                     link this single file (no link-order guessing)

Notes
-----
* Built with the platform toolchain shipped in this archive; consumers
  must use a compatible compiler.
* iroha-lib additionally requires the third-party dependencies
  (protobuf, gRPC, Boost, spdlog, rapidjson, gflags, fmt, OpenSSL) -
  install them with vcpkg or provide your own builds.
* TLS support: pass --tls_root_cert to iroha-cli / use TlsOptions in
  iroha-lib for one-way TLS to torii.
